@startuml
' OWNER-MVP-2026-11-04 review: Reference / design method. Native Git/OO/data notation illustration, not a commitment to advanced product features.
allowmixing
title Proposed — Package diagram: acyclic source dependencies
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
skinparam maxMessageSize 65

package "Composition root" as ROOT
package "Presentation transport" as WEB
package "Presentation application" as APP
package "Presentation domain" as DOMAIN
package "Presentation required ports" as PORTS
package "Infrastructure adapters" as INFRA
ROOT ..> WEB
ROOT ..> INFRA
WEB ..> APP
APP ..> DOMAIN
APP ..> PORTS
PORTS ..> DOMAIN : contract values
INFRA ..> PORTS
INFRA ..> DOMAIN : mapping values

@enduml
